{
  "kind": "Panel",
  "spec": {
    "id": 42,
    "title": "SoundCloud plays & engagement ${chart}",
    "description": "Per day (time ranges over 7 days): plays gained since the day before, from the bridge's own daily record (SoundCloud's API only gives totals; blank when the day before wasn't recorded, or the total went down, e.g. a track deleted). The thin dashed line is each day's number, the bold one the 7-day average (of the days the bridge has among the 7 ending that day; it starts once 4 of them are there): the trend, through the day-to-day ups and downs. Violet lines are this network's posts: hover one to see what went out; a rise just after one is that post working. Hour by hour (when the time range is 7 days or less): what came in between the bridge's checks (about once an hour; a point after a gap covers the gap), no 7-day line. Kept for the last 90 days (ACCOUNT_CHECK_DAYS); further back, pick per day. Both follow the dashboard's time range. Engagement (blue) = likes, comments and reposts added up, from the gains in your tracks' totals since the day before (SoundCloud's API only gives totals); hover for each, and for the engagement rate: the 7 days' engagement as a share of the 7 days' plays, comparable between networks. Engagement has its own scale, on the right (it's usually a small share of the plays): lines moving together = a steady rate; engagement rising faster = posts landing better, slower = more people seeing them but fewer joining in. Hour by hour has no rate.",
    "links": [],
    "data": {
      "kind": "QueryGroup",
      "spec": {
        "queries": [
          {
            "kind": "PanelQuery",
            "spec": {
              "query": {
                "kind": "DataQuery",
                "group": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
                "version": "v0",
                "datasource": {
                  "name": "bridge-instagram"
                },
                "spec": {
                  "columns": [
                    {
                      "selector": "date",
                      "text": "Date",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "newPlays",
                      "text": "Plays",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "newPlays7",
                      "text": "Plays, 7-day average",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "engagement",
                      "text": "Engagement",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "engagement7",
                      "text": "Engagement, 7-day average",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "rate7",
                      "text": "Engagement rate, 7-day",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "newLikes",
                      "text": "Likes",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "newComments",
                      "text": "Comments",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "newReposts",
                      "text": "Reposts",
                      "type": "number"
                    }
                  ],
                  "filters": [],
                  "format": "table",
                  "parser": "backend",
                  "root_selector": "\"${chart}\" = \"hour by hour\" ? [] : daily",
                  "source": "url",
                  "type": "json",
                  "url": "http://postiz-ghost-bridge:8080/soundcloud.json",
                  "url_options": {
                    "data": "",
                    "method": "GET"
                  }
                }
              },
              "refId": "A",
              "hidden": false
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "PanelQuery",
            "spec": {
